For planar movement the angular velocity vector is directed along the unit vector __MATH_641__ which is perpendicular to the plane of movement. Introduce the unit vectors __MATH_642__ from the reference point __MATH_643__ to a point __MATH_644__, and the unit vector __MATH_645__, so
